  "description": "XFINIUM.PDF library is a cross platform library for PDF development. It supports a wide set of features, ranging from simple PDF creation to form filling, content redaction, complex color conversions or PDF rendering. The simple object model follows the PDF specification so you can have complete control over the generated PDF files. Code written for XFINIUM.PDF can be compiled on all supported platforms without changes.\n\t\n\tThe XFINIUM.PDF.View control is a PDF viewer control for Windows Presentation Foundation running on .NET, .NET Core and .NET Framework.\n\tIt supports:\n\t• Document navigation (page up/down)\n \t• Page zoom in/out\n \t• FitWidth zoom mode\n \t• Add and remove pages\n \t• PageClick and PageDoubleClick events\n    \n    The Xfinium.Pdf.View.NET.Wpf assembly is part of XFINIUM.PDF Viewer CROSS PLATFORM package: http://xfiniumpdf.com/xfinium-pdf-crossplatform/xfinium-pdf-packages.html\n    ",
